  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">VERIFICACION DE LOS GASTOS del contrato de la subvencion Asociaci&#xf3;n Civil Sistema B Paraguay: LA/2020/417-533 &#xab;Asunci&#xf3;n +B&#xbb;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract related to: VERIFICACION DE LOS GASTOS del contrato de la subvencion Asociaci&#xf3;n Civil Sistema B Paraguay: LA/2020/417-533 &#xab;Asunci&#xf3;n +B&#xbb; - The Regional Cooperation Facility 2023 supports the implementation of the Global Gateway strategy for the LAC region and in particular its EU-LAC Global Gateway Investment agenda (GGIA) through: (1) the five regional priority areas identified in the panamerican window of the regional MIP (technical assistance, policy dialogues, regional strategic communication), (2) the 6 Latin American countries that have no bilateral MIP in their bilateral TEIs, policy dialogue and cooperation/partnership priorities, and (3) EU interests in the LAC region, the bi-regional partnership and the external dimension of EU policies.Based on Mid Term review outcomes the Regional Cooperation Facility will respond to GGIA needs embedded in components A7 and A8 of the Pan-American window as well as in the &#xbf;support to investment&#xbf; envelop.</narrative>
  </description>
